{ Castles kingside by Black. } 8. c3
{ Pawn to c3 by Ian, inviting the Marshall attack. This is a matter of honor - if someone plays c3 against you and you don't want to be the laughing stock of the world, you play the Marshall attack. Everyone loves to play it. }
8... d5
{ Pawn to d5 - the Marshall attack! Not even in the top three engine recommendations (engine prefers Nd5, d6, Re8), but it's what everyone wants to play. Both players blitzed out the moves up to this point. }
